WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.538 --> 00:00:04.504
(gentle guitar music)

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.400
- [Kamilla] We've been called
crazy a lot of different times

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.567
by a lot of different people (chuckles).

00:00:12.481 --> 00:00:13.554
We were coming with something

00:00:13.554 --> 00:00:16.022
that nobody had ever
put on the table before,

00:00:16.022 --> 00:00:18.939
so people didn't know how to react.

00:00:22.566 --> 00:00:23.866
My name is Kamilla Seidler.

00:00:23.866 --> 00:00:25.534
We're in Bolivia in La Paz

00:00:25.534 --> 00:00:29.548
in Restaurant Gustu where
I'm the executive head chef.

00:00:29.548 --> 00:00:33.164
Gustu is a crazy restaurant
on a mountain (laughs).

00:00:33.164 --> 00:00:35.926
It started out as a small
culinary school project,

00:00:35.926 --> 00:00:39.257
and then we decided to go big.

00:00:39.257 --> 00:00:41.307
- [Narrator] Founded by
globally-celebrated chef,

00:00:41.307 --> 00:00:42.494
Claus Meyer,

00:00:42.494 --> 00:00:46.989
Gustu is a unique culinary
experiment in social outreach.

00:00:46.989 --> 00:00:48.025
The goal?

00:00:48.025 --> 00:00:50.869
Proving that food can do
more than just feed people.

00:00:50.869 --> 00:00:53.752
It can educate and inspire.

00:00:53.752 --> 00:00:56.267
One of the poorest
countries in Latin America,

00:00:56.267 --> 00:00:59.516
but with an abundance of
diverse and obscure ingredients,

00:00:59.516 --> 00:01:03.735
Bolivia seemed to be the
perfect spot to set up shop.

00:01:03.735 --> 00:01:06.619
- The idea of giving something
back in a developing country

00:01:06.619 --> 00:01:09.505
is where Gustu comes into the picture.

00:01:09.505 --> 00:01:10.886
- [Narrator] Gustu's goal is to train

00:01:10.886 --> 00:01:12.513
a new generation of Bolivians

00:01:12.513 --> 00:01:15.802
to cook, prepare, and
serve high-end cuisine

00:01:15.802 --> 00:01:18.286
using only Bolivian ingredients.

00:01:18.286 --> 00:01:22.270
(speaking in a foreign language)

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:23.537
- [Kamilla] Gustu's not meant to be

00:01:23.537 --> 00:01:24.850
a typical culinary school.

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.654
It's meant to be a
learning-by-doing institute.

00:01:27.654 --> 00:01:29.978
Education needs to come with care.

00:01:29.978 --> 00:01:34.145
You can't educate somebody
if you don't care about them.

00:01:38.607 --> 00:01:42.690
(speaking in a foreign language)

00:02:03.496 --> 00:02:04.522
- [Kamilla] There's a lot of potential,

00:02:04.522 --> 00:02:05.497
there's a lot of energy,

00:02:05.497 --> 00:02:06.879
there's a lot of pride.

00:02:06.879 --> 00:02:10.658
One of the big things we're
doing is empowering people, yes.

00:02:10.658 --> 00:02:13.279
It's a movement that
touches the whole society.

00:02:13.279 --> 00:02:15.862
(upbeat music)

